          "location": {
            "name": "Filoti main square",
            "countryCode": "GR",
            "city": "Filoti",
            "area": "Village square"
          },
          "notes": "Day rate for a small car — Naxos is the one Cycladic island where a car beats a quad, because the mountain road is long and cold at 07:00. The trail starts on the steps opposite Taverna Baboulas on the square. You can also drive on to the tiny Aria Spring car park and save 40 minutes of road walking, but it holds six cars and fills by 08:00.",
