          },
          "location": {
            "name": "Portara and the Kastro lanes",
            "lat": 36.870658,
            "lng": 25.521091,
            "countryCode": "GR",
            "city": "Naxos Town",
            "area": "Palatia and Kastro",
            "precision": "city"
          },
          "notes": "The marble door frame on the islet is a five-minute causeway walk from the port and is the one sunset on Naxos worth planning around. Then go up into the Kastro rather than eating on the waterfront — the port tavernas have the view and the village ones have the food. Book, because the good ones inside the walls have eight tables.",
